Implement Phase 4.3 - Dependency Engine.

Goal:
Planner unlocks tasks only when all dependencies succeed.

Requirements:
- READY only if every dependency SUCCESS.
- FAILED dependency blocks descendants.
- BLOCKED state supported.
- Planner API:
  canRun(task)
  unblockChildren(task)
- Never execute child before parent.
- Add dependency diagnostics.
- Existing tests must continue passing.